      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "Max: So, back in the project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "it's time for new components, or for new routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "Because thus far, we have our recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 11.58,
          "en": "and we have our shopping list area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "We now need some area where we can sign in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 19.14,
          "en": "And my idea here is that in our application here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.14,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "we have a auth page, an authentication page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 24.57,
          "en": "where users can sign up and log in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.57,
          "end": 26.79,
          "en": "And that auth page is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.79,
          "end": 29.16,
          "en": "available in an unauthenticated state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.16,
          "end": 30.99,
          "en": "So the user doesn't need to be logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.99,
          "end": 32.64,
          "en": "to visit this auth page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.64,
          "end": 35.13,
          "en": "because forcing the user to be logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.13,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "would defeat the purpose of an authentication page, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "The recipes page, on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 42.87,
          "en": "that page should be locked down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.87,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "and should not be available if the user is not logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "And the same for that manage drop down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 50.52,
          "en": "It should only be shown if the user is logged in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.52,
          "end": 52.89,
          "en": "because otherwise you can't interact with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 55.56,
          "en": "Or we could, but these actions shouldn't do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.56,
          "end": 57.84,
          "en": "because that will actually change to requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.84,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "that need authentication to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 62.67,
          "en": "The shopping list should always be accessible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.67,
          "end": 65.28,
          "en": "though, of course, you are free to also edit this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 69.03,
          "en": "and lock both routes down if you're not authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 73.41,
          "en": "With that, let's start by adding a new area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.41,
          "end": 74.733,
          "en": "in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 79.08,
          "en": "which I'll create here in my app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.08,
          "end": 80.61,
          "en": "which I'll name auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.61,
          "end": 81.48,
          "en": "And, in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.48,
          "end": 84.66,
          "en": "we need a auth.component.ts file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.66,
          "end": 88.35,
          "en": "and an auth.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "which is the template for the auth.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 94.83,
          "en": "Now, in our auth component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 97.343,
          "en": "we export a class, AuthComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 99.47999999999999,
          "en": "and, as you learn,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "such a component is created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "by adding the @Component decorator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 106.17,
          "en": "And there we need to define a selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.17,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "which in my case here will be app-auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "And we also need to tell Angular where to find our template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 113.243,
          "en": "and that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 113.243,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "will be my auth.component.html file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 118.92,
          "en": "in the same folder as this component list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 118.92,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "Now, as you also learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 121.747,
          "en": "a component needs to be declared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 121.747,
          "end": 124.26,
          "en": "such that Angular understands it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.26,
          "end": 126.51,
          "en": "And for this we can go to the app module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 126.51,
          "end": 129.139,
          "en": "and here we simply add it to our declarations array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 129.139,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "The AuthComponent simply added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 133.59,
          "en": "and make sure you also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 136.203,
          "en": "add an import path to that newly created file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 141.21,
          "en": "With all of that out the way, this new component exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 141.21,
          "end": 144.9,
          "en": "Now, of course, we can work on that template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 144.9,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "And for this I'll add a bootstrap row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 150.12,
          "en": "so a div with class row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.12,
          "end": 154.11,
          "en": "and a column xs-12 to take the full width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.11,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "on all screen sizes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 158.04,
          "en": "And, in there, I want to have a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 158.04,
          "end": 161.76,
          "en": "and that form should be my, well, sign up and log in form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 161.76,
          "end": 163.5,
          "en": "And we'll add a button that allows the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 163.5,
          "end": 165.243,
          "en": "to toggle between both modes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 166.53,
          "end": 169.26,
          "en": "In the form, I'll add my form-group div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 169.26,
          "end": 171.32999999999998,
          "en": "which is a bootstrap class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 174.683,
          "en": "to wrap a label and an input together basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 174.683,
          "end": 177.36,
          "en": "And I will then add a label here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.36,
          "end": 179.91,
          "en": "for my email input, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 179.91,
          "end": 181.35,
          "en": "That also means that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "we should add an input with class form-control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 186.33,
          "en": "so that it looks good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 186.33,
          "end": 189.96,
          "en": "because the class form-control is offered by bootstrap.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 189.96,
          "end": 193.74,
          "en": "And I will give this my email type here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.74,
          "end": 196.292,
          "en": "It will also get the id of email for accessibility reasons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 196.292,
          "end": 199.26,
          "en": "so that this belongs to this label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 199.26,
          "end": 201.54,
          "en": "And, with that, we should have that first input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 201.54,
          "end": 203.64,
          "en": "Let's now add a second input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 203.64,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "This will be the input for the password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 209.52,
          "en": "So the for, type, and id here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 209.52,
          "end": 210.93,
          "en": "will all be password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.93,
          "end": 214.262,
          "en": "Type password ensures that the characters are hidden.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 214.262,
          "end": 217.38,
          "en": "And we also need a button, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 221.209,
          "en": "So let's add another div here with a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 221.209,
          "end": 225.22,
          "en": "which also gets a class btn-primary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 226.47,
          "end": 229.53,
          "en": "where we can say Sign Up for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 229.53,
          "end": 231.81,
          "en": "and this will later also dynamically change the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 231.81,
          "end": 233.34,
          "en": "based on the mode we're in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 233.34,
          "end": 235.59,
          "en": "Because for that, I will add another button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 235.59,
          "end": 238.11,
          "en": "and another div below that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 238.11,
          "end": 241.53,
          "en": "And there I will simply say, Switch to Login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 241.53,
          "end": 244.5,
          "en": "which, of course, later will also have a dynamic caption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 244.5,
          "end": 248.88,
          "en": "And, with that, let's make sure we can see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 248.88,
          "end": 252.33,
          "en": "by ensuring that we can load this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 252.33,
          "end": 254.85,
          "en": "or this component route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 254.85,
          "end": 256.77,
          "en": "And, for that, in app-routing module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 256.77,
          "end": 259.95,
          "en": "I wanna register a new route which loads the auth page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 259.95,
          "end": 263.22,
          "en": "So, here, we can register a new path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 263.22,
          "end": 265.5,
          "en": "which can just be auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 265.5,
          "end": 267.42,
          "en": "The name is up to you though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 267.42,
          "end": 270.21,
          "en": "Or the path is up to you, what you want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 270.21,
          "end": 273.51,
          "en": "And there, the component I wanna load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 273.51,
          "end": 275.4,
          "en": "will be the AuthComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 275.4,
          "end": 276.33,
          "en": "And for that to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 276.33,
          "end": 277.74,
          "en": "you need to make sure that you add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 277.74,
          "end": 280.04,
          "en": "the import path up there to the AuthComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.041,
          "end": 283.23,
          "en": "If you now save all of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 283.23,
          "end": 285.453,
          "en": "and you enter /auth here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 286.35,
          "end": 288.562,
          "en": "this is the form we're getting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 288.562,
          "end": 289.89,
          "en": "Doesn't look too bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 289.89,
          "end": 292.17,
          "en": "Of course, you can change the styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
